        '0.9': 'Struck by the rakshasa\'s arrows, the great monkey grew angry; then he saw beside him a huge, broad rock.',
        '0.10': 'The mighty one quickly wrenched it up and hurled it with force; the enraged rakshasa struck it down with ten arrows.',
